<title>AUSTRIA: IRAN'S OIL MINISTER ARRIVES IN VIENNA.</title>
<headline>IRAN'S OIL MINISTER ARRIVES IN VIENNA.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iranian oil minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh arrived in the Austrian capital on Monday for this week's OPEC conference but made no comment to reporters.</p>
<p>Aghazadeh, the first OPEC  minister to arrive in Vienna, is scheduled to chair OPEC's three-man quota compliance committee meeting on Tuesday afternoon.</p>
<p>The full conference opens on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
